<title>USA: Evans Withycombe appoints Berry president.</title>
<headline>Evans Withycombe appoints Berry president.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evans Withycombe Residential Inc said Tuesday that Richard Berry has been appointed president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The company said Berry, who has served as executive vice president and director, succeeds Keith Withycombe, who will continue as a company director.</p>
<p>The Arizona-based real estate investment Trust said Berry's appointment is in line with its management transition program.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
